{"id": 5430, "title": "Colour", "level": "Intermediate", "hsk_tags": ["HSK3"], "slug": "colour", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/5430_colour.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["普通人可能很难理解颜色的重要性。十二岁的小男孩Jonathan有严重的色盲，他的校长把自己的眼镜借给男孩戴以后，小男孩哭起来。原来他的校长也有色盲，这是为色盲特别制作的眼镜，这是小男孩第一次看清楚不同的颜色，原来有颜色的世界是这样的。"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["普通人可能很難理解顏色的重要性。十二歲的小男孩Jonathan有嚴重的色盲，他的校長把自己的眼鏡借給男孩戴以後，小男孩哭起來。原來他的校長也有色盲，這是為色盲特別製作的眼鏡，這是小男孩第一次看清楚不同的顏色，原來有顏色的世界是這樣的。"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["pǔ tōng rén kě néng hěn nán lǐ jiě yán sè de zhòng yào xìng。 shí èr suì de xiǎo nán hái Jonathan yǒu yán zhòng de sè máng， tā de xiào zhǎng bǎ zì jǐ de yǎn jìng jiè gěi nán hái dài yǐ hòu， xiǎo nán hái kū qǐ lái。 yuán lái tā de xiào zhǎng yě yǒu sè máng， zhè shì wèi sè máng tè bié zhì zuò de yǎn jìng， zhè shì xiǎo nán hái dì yī cì kàn qīng chu bù tóng de yán sè， yuán lái yǒu yán sè de shì jiè shì zhè yàng de。"], "english_paragraphs": ["It may be difficult for ordinary people to understand the importance of color. A twelve-year-old boy, Jonathan, has severe color blindness. After his principal lent the boy his glasses, he started crying. It turns out that his principal also has color blindness. These glasses are specially made for color blindness. This is the first time the little boy can see different colors clearly. It turns out that the world with colors is like this."], "english_full": "It may be difficult for ordinary people to understand the importance of color. A twelve-year-old boy, Jonathan, has severe color blindness. After his principal lent the boy his glasses, he started crying. It turns out that his principal also has color blindness. These glasses are specially made for color blindness. This is the first time the little boy can see different colors clearly. It turns out that the world with colors is like this.", "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"pǔ tōng\" data-defn=\"common / ordinary / general / average\" data-hsk=\"HSK 4\"><span class=\"si\">普通</span><span class=\"tr\">普